license: MIT
abstract: >-
  An exact reversible mass-action system on three species with one linkage
  class and positive integer rates. Its sole positive compatibility class
  contains a compact algebraic ellipse of equilibria, while the three
  coordinate polynomials of its vector field have greatest common divisor one.
